WEBVTT

00:01.280 --> 00:02.280
all: Behold!
全体：看哪！

00:02.280 --> 00:03.980
We are the Greek chorus.
我们是希腊合唱团。

00:03.980 --> 00:06.646
We narrate this epic tale
我们讲述这个史诗般的故事

00:06.646 --> 00:08.880
of stupidity.
的愚蠢。

00:08.880 --> 00:11.880
[upbeat music]
[欢快的音乐]

00:11.880 --> 00:17.280
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

00:17.280 --> 00:18.913
[clear throats]
[清嗓子]

00:18.913 --> 00:21.013
Behold Neptune,
看海王星，

00:21.013 --> 00:22.946
god of the sea,
海神，

00:22.946 --> 00:25.346
with his mighty trident,
带着他强大的三叉戟，

00:25.346 --> 00:28.080
a weapon so powerful
如此强大的武器

00:28.080 --> 00:31.746
nothing is beyond
its user's reach.
没有什么是超越的
它的用户范围。

00:31.746 --> 00:34.280
Behold the Kraken.
看海妖。

00:34.280 --> 00:37.913
- [snarling]
- [咆哮]

00:37.913 --> 00:40.080
all: Gross monster.
全体：恶心的怪物。

00:40.080 --> 00:41.146
- [snarling]
- [咆哮]

00:41.146 --> 00:42.646
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

00:46.280 --> 00:48.746
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

00:51.046 --> 00:53.413
- [screaming]
- [尖叫]

00:53.413 --> 00:56.480
all: Behold Neptune triumphant.
所有人：看海王星胜利了。

00:56.480 --> 00:59.580
What an awesome dude.
多么棒的家伙啊。

00:59.580 --> 01:03.113
Behold this idiot
and beware,
看看这个白痴
并注意，

01:03.113 --> 01:06.913
for trident trouble comes.
因为三叉戟的麻烦来了。

01:06.913 --> 01:08.946
- Sorry.
- Eh.
- 对不起。
- 呃。

01:08.946 --> 01:10.480
all: See?
全体：看到了吗？

01:12.580 --> 01:14.680
all chanting:
Food! Food! Food!
所有人都在喊口号：
食物！食物！食物！

01:14.680 --> 01:16.280
Food! Food!
食物！食物！

01:16.280 --> 01:17.746
- Food! Food!
- 食物！食物！

01:17.746 --> 01:18.813
Oh.
哦。

01:18.813 --> 01:21.080
- Hey, I was still
reading that!
- 嘿，我还在
读那个！

01:21.080 --> 01:23.946
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

01:23.946 --> 01:25.313
- Forget the stupid comic.
- 忘记那些愚蠢的漫画吧。

01:25.313 --> 01:26.746
We've got a situation here.
我们这里有情况。

01:26.746 --> 01:28.513
We don't have
any Krabby Patties,
我们没有
任何蟹黄饼，

01:28.513 --> 01:31.313
and these animals are trying
to eat us instead.
这些动物正在尝试
来吃我们。

01:31.313 --> 01:32.680
[chomp]
[咀嚼]

01:32.680 --> 01:35.680
Hey, who's responsible
for this?
哎，谁负责
为了这个？

01:38.380 --> 01:40.846
- Get to flipping
those patties fast, boy-o!
- 开始翻转
这些肉饼快了，天啊！

01:40.846 --> 01:43.280
Before we all become
the lunch special.
在我们都成为之前
特别午餐。

01:43.280 --> 01:45.413
- I'm on it, Mr. Krabs.
- 我正在处理，蟹老板。

01:45.413 --> 01:47.046
[bowling pins rattling]
[保龄球瓶嘎嘎作响]

01:47.046 --> 01:48.746
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

01:48.746 --> 01:50.713
- [sighs]
- [叹气]

01:50.713 --> 01:52.646
[straining]
[紧张]

01:55.880 --> 01:58.080
Oh, the toppings
haven't been prepped.
哦，配料
还没有准备好。

01:58.080 --> 02:01.280
I wish this lettuce and tomato
would just cut themselves up.
我希望这个生菜和西红柿
只会割伤自己。

02:03.346 --> 02:04.813
- Let's do this!
- 让我们这样做吧！

02:04.813 --> 02:07.546
- Yeah, cut me up good,
girlfriend.
- 是啊，把我切好，
女朋友。

02:07.546 --> 02:11.346
[all grunting]
- Huh.
[全都咕哝]
- 嗯。

02:11.346 --> 02:13.380
I guess I did cut up
the toppings after all.
我想我确实剪了
毕竟配料。

02:13.380 --> 02:15.046
- 37 Krabby Patties!
- 37 个蟹肉饼！

02:15.046 --> 02:17.546
Fast!
Ahhh!
快速地！
啊啊！

02:17.546 --> 02:18.746
- 37 patties?
- 37块肉饼？

02:18.746 --> 02:20.880
How am I gonna flip 37 patties?
我该如何翻转 37 个肉饼？

02:20.880 --> 02:23.680
Huh, has my spatula
always had three heads?
嗯，有我的铲子
总是有三个头？

02:23.680 --> 02:25.013
all: No!
全体：不！

02:25.013 --> 02:27.580
And it is not a spatula.
而且它不是抹刀。

02:27.580 --> 02:30.746
- Get them patties
out here fast, SpongeBob!
- 给他们买肉饼
快出来吧，海绵宝宝！

02:30.746 --> 02:32.646
Ahh!
啊！

02:32.646 --> 02:34.146
- Well, I wish
these Krabby Patties
- 嗯，我希望
这些蟹肉饼

02:34.146 --> 02:37.480
would just serve themselves
so I could keep cooking.
只会为自己服务
这样我就可以继续做饭了。

02:37.480 --> 02:39.780
[magical music]
[魔幻音乐]

02:39.780 --> 02:40.846
- Hey!
- 嘿！

02:40.846 --> 02:42.280
- Yay!
- 耶！

02:42.280 --> 02:43.280
- Yeah!
- 是的！

02:43.280 --> 02:44.613
[all cheering]
[大家欢呼]

02:44.613 --> 02:47.680
- Whoa, my spatula
never did that before.
- 哇哦，我的铲子
以前从未这样做过。

02:47.680 --> 02:50.146
all: Krabby Patty!
Krabby Patty!
所有人：蟹蟹帕蒂！
蟹蟹帕蒂！

02:50.146 --> 02:52.480
Krabby Patty!
Krabby Patty!
蟹蟹帕蒂！
蟹蟹帕蒂！

02:52.480 --> 02:53.746
- [laughs]
- [笑]

02:53.746 --> 02:55.846
- [straining]
Huh?
- [紧张]
啊？

02:55.846 --> 02:57.913
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

02:57.913 --> 03:00.080
- [giggles]
- [咯咯笑]

03:00.080 --> 03:02.013
- [laughing]
- [笑]

03:04.113 --> 03:06.046
[both laughing]
[两人都笑了]

03:08.780 --> 03:09.846
- Mmm.
- 嗯。

03:09.846 --> 03:11.180
- Huh?
- 啊？

03:11.180 --> 03:12.913
[laughing]
[笑]

03:12.913 --> 03:14.880
I don't know how
you're doing this, boy-o,
我不知道怎么办
你正在这样做，男孩，

03:14.880 --> 03:16.046
but keep it up.
但请坚持下去。

03:16.046 --> 03:17.746
Folks will pay
every cent they have
人们会付出代价
他们拥有的每一分钱

03:17.746 --> 03:19.346
to watch Krabby Patties dance.
观看蟹肉饼跳舞。

03:19.346 --> 03:21.346
Look at how cute they are.
看看他们多可爱。

03:21.346 --> 03:22.580
- Hey.
- Oh!
- 嘿。
- 哦！

03:22.580 --> 03:25.046
- Whoo!
- Whoo-whee!
- 呼！
- 呼呼！

03:25.046 --> 03:27.280
- We're running out
of them dancing patties.
- 我们快没了
他们跳舞的馅饼。

03:27.280 --> 03:29.380
Faster, boy-o!
Faster!
快点，男孩！
快点！

03:29.380 --> 03:32.280
- [panting]
- [气喘吁吁]

03:32.280 --> 03:34.913
Dance!
Come on, dance!
舞蹈！
来吧，跳舞吧！

03:34.913 --> 03:37.446
I'm trying, Mr. Krabs.
I'm trying.
我正在努力，蟹老板。
我想。

03:37.446 --> 03:39.413
Come on, you, work!
加油，你，工作吧！

03:39.413 --> 03:41.546
- [grumbling]
- [抱怨]

03:43.880 --> 03:46.946
all: The sponge has angered
the trident.
全体：海绵生气了
三叉戟。

03:46.946 --> 03:49.080
Trouble comes.
麻烦来了。

03:49.080 --> 03:51.013
- [groaning]
- [呻吟]

03:55.546 --> 03:58.846
- Ahh!
[angry grumbling]
- 啊！
[愤怒的抱怨]

03:58.846 --> 04:01.546
- Ah.
- 啊。

04:01.546 --> 04:02.980
- [giggles]
- [咯咯笑]

04:02.980 --> 04:05.913
- [snarling]
- [咆哮]

04:05.913 --> 04:06.913
Ahh!
啊！

04:06.913 --> 04:09.113
- [growls]
- [咆哮]

04:09.113 --> 04:10.546
[all screaming]
[所有人尖叫]

04:14.146 --> 04:15.546
- No!
- 不！

04:15.546 --> 04:17.746
This is gonna
cost me money!
这将
花了我钱！

04:17.746 --> 04:20.513
- Mr. Krabs, I wish
you wouldn't worry about money
- 蟹老板先生，我希望
你不会担心钱的问题

04:20.513 --> 04:22.113
at a time like this.
在这样的时刻。

04:22.113 --> 04:24.446
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

04:24.446 --> 04:26.580
Right you are, boy-o.
你是对的，男孩。

04:30.313 --> 04:32.280
Here, take this.
Here you go.
给，拿着这个。
干得好。

04:32.280 --> 04:33.946
I can't stop!
我停不下来！

04:33.946 --> 04:35.146
[both screaming]
[两人尖叫]

04:35.146 --> 04:37.713
- There you go.
What's happening to me!
- 就这样吧。
我这是怎么了！

04:37.713 --> 04:40.846
- What is going on
around here?
- 发生了什么事
这附近？

04:40.846 --> 04:42.846
- Ahem.
- 咳咳。

04:42.846 --> 04:46.846
- Hey, what's this?
- 嘿，这是什么？

04:46.846 --> 04:48.180
Whoa!
哇！

04:48.180 --> 04:50.446
My spatula is magic.
我的铲子有魔法。

04:50.446 --> 04:53.613
all: Magic, magic, magic.
全部：魔法，魔法，魔法。

04:53.613 --> 04:55.113
- This is awesome.
- 这太棒了。

04:55.113 --> 04:58.946
I will use this magic spatula
to help everyone.
我会用这个神奇的抹刀
来帮助大家。

05:03.413 --> 05:06.413
[humming]
[嗡嗡声]

05:06.413 --> 05:08.546
- I'll have two, please.
- 请给我两个。

05:08.546 --> 05:10.680
- [crying]
- [哭泣]

05:10.680 --> 05:11.946
- [whistling]
- [吹口哨]

05:11.946 --> 05:14.180
[gasps]
I'll help you, baby!
[喘气]
我会帮助你的，宝贝！

05:14.180 --> 05:15.380
Boing!
噗！

05:15.380 --> 05:16.446
[whistles]
[口哨声]

05:16.446 --> 05:18.580
- [crying]
- [哭泣]

05:25.280 --> 05:28.013
- What's wrong, grass?
Why won't you grow?
-怎么了，草？
你为什么不成长？

05:28.013 --> 05:29.946
Talk to me.
跟我说话。

05:34.480 --> 05:36.613
Oh.
Mm.
哦。
毫米。

05:41.813 --> 05:44.680
- We'll do more than just
talk to yous.
- 我们会做的不仅仅是
和你谈谈。

05:44.680 --> 05:47.146
Let's see how you like
getting mowed.
让我们看看你喜欢什么
被割草。

05:47.146 --> 05:48.946
- Ahhh!
- 啊啊！

05:52.980 --> 05:54.880
- There is no problem
I cannot solve,
- 没有问题
我无法解决，

05:54.880 --> 05:58.280
for I am SpongeBob,
Emperor of the Sea.
因为我是海绵宝宝，
海皇。

05:58.280 --> 06:01.113
[triumphant music]
[胜利的音乐]

06:01.113 --> 06:04.446
Hey, get outta here,
you pesky jellyfish!
嘿，离开这里，
你这个讨厌的水母！

06:04.446 --> 06:07.146
all: Whoa, slow your roll.
所有人：哇哦，放慢你的速度。

06:07.146 --> 06:10.613
Only Neptune,
true ruler of the sea,
只有海王星，
真正的海洋统治者，

06:10.613 --> 06:13.513
can control the trident.
可以控制三叉戟。

06:13.513 --> 06:15.913
- [laughs]
- [笑]

06:15.913 --> 06:18.013
- So I say, "Look, Zeus,
- 所以我说，“看，宙斯，

06:18.013 --> 06:20.046
"either you come up
with more money
“要么你上来
有更多的钱

06:20.046 --> 06:21.680
or Neptune walks."
或海王星行走。”

06:21.680 --> 06:25.146
- [chuckles]
- [轻笑]

06:25.146 --> 06:26.413
- There he is, ma.
- 他在那儿，妈妈。

06:26.413 --> 06:28.413
That's the man who hit me.
就是那个打我的人。

06:28.413 --> 06:30.313
[sobs]
[抽泣]

06:30.313 --> 06:32.546
- Don't cry, baby.
- 别哭，宝贝。

06:32.546 --> 06:34.580
Mother will handle this.
妈妈会处理这件事。

06:34.580 --> 06:37.080
[snarls]
[咆哮]

06:37.080 --> 06:39.446
- Let us battle!
- 让我们战斗吧！

06:39.446 --> 06:41.546
Take that!
拿那个！

06:41.546 --> 06:43.580
- Huh?
- 啊？

06:44.746 --> 06:48.346
This is dry-clean only,
you monster!
这只能干洗，
你这个怪物！

06:48.346 --> 06:49.680
- Ooh.
Huh?
- 哦。
啊？

06:49.680 --> 06:52.980
"Property of SpongeBob"?
“海绵宝宝的财产”？

06:52.980 --> 06:55.146
- [snarls]
- [咆哮]

06:55.146 --> 06:56.480
- Uh-oh.
- 呃哦。

06:56.480 --> 06:58.613
[screams]
[尖叫声]

07:03.346 --> 07:04.813
- Hey, SpongeBob.
- 嘿，海绵宝宝。

07:04.813 --> 07:07.613
You look so sparkly today.
你今天看起来很闪闪发光。

07:07.613 --> 07:10.180
- Of course I do,
for I am SpongeBob,
- 我当然知道，
因为我是海绵宝宝，

07:10.180 --> 07:11.580
Emperor of the Sea.
海皇。

07:11.580 --> 07:13.280
[triumphant music]
[胜利的音乐]

07:13.280 --> 07:14.280
- Oh.
- 哦。

07:15.913 --> 07:18.580
No!
My ice cream!
不！
我的冰淇淋！

07:18.580 --> 07:22.580
Ohh, why is the world
so full of pain?
噢，世界为何如此
如此充满痛苦？

07:22.580 --> 07:25.713
[sobs]
[抽泣]

07:25.713 --> 07:27.746
- Fear not,
bestest of friends.
- 不要害怕，
最好的朋友。

07:27.746 --> 07:29.780
You shall have all the ice cream
you could ever eat.
所有的冰淇淋都给你
你可以吃。

07:29.780 --> 07:33.646
all: No, you'll only
make it worse.
全部：不，你只会
让情况变得更糟。

07:33.646 --> 07:35.513
[upbeat jingle]
[欢快的顺口溜]

07:35.513 --> 07:37.013
[music sputters, stops]
[音乐噼啪作响，停止]

07:37.013 --> 07:40.813
- Ahhh!
Best day ever!
- 啊啊！
有史以来最好的一天！

07:40.813 --> 07:43.080
- No, worst day ever.
- 不，这是有史以来最糟糕的一天。

07:43.080 --> 07:44.113
Oh, my back.
哦，我的背。

07:44.113 --> 07:45.380
all: See?
全体：看到了吗？

07:45.380 --> 07:47.313
- I can fix this.
- 我可以解决这个问题。

07:50.613 --> 07:53.446
- Hooray!
- 万岁！

07:53.446 --> 07:54.780
- Boo!
- 嘘！

07:54.780 --> 07:57.446
- I think I know a way
to make you both happy.
- 我想我知道一个办法
让你们俩都开心。

07:57.446 --> 07:59.113
all: You really don't.
全体：你真的不知道。

07:59.113 --> 08:01.946
How do you not
get that by now?
你怎么不
现在明白了吗？

08:05.446 --> 08:08.946
- An ice cream geyser!
- 冰淇淋间歇泉！

08:11.546 --> 08:13.180
Ahh!
啊！

08:20.346 --> 08:21.846
Brain freeze!
大脑冻结！

08:21.846 --> 08:23.613
I can't eat it all.
我不能全部吃完。

08:23.613 --> 08:28.346
Ah, I've never been
more disappointed in myself.
啊，我从来没有去过
对自己更加失望。

08:29.913 --> 08:32.213
[dramatic music]
[戏剧音乐]

08:32.213 --> 08:34.280
[all screaming]
[所有人尖叫]

08:34.280 --> 08:36.813
- Ooh, I like choc--
- 哦，我喜欢巧克力--

08:36.813 --> 08:39.380
- Oh, the creamy,
delicious horror.
- 哦，奶油味的，
美味的恐怖。

08:40.346 --> 08:41.980
- Save us, SpongeBob!
- 拯救我们，海绵宝宝！

08:41.980 --> 08:43.046
Save us!
救救我们吧！

08:43.046 --> 08:45.746
No wait.
无需等待。

08:45.746 --> 08:47.446
Okay, now save us!
好吧，现在拯救我们吧！

08:47.446 --> 08:51.213
- Stop, ice cream!
Stop! Stop!
- 停下来，冰淇淋！
停止！停止！

08:51.213 --> 08:52.313
- Hmm?
- 唔？

08:52.313 --> 08:53.813
[rumbling]
[隆隆声]

08:53.813 --> 08:54.846
[both scream]
[两人尖叫]

08:54.846 --> 08:56.913
- Oh, I just made it worse.
- 哦，我只是让事情变得更糟了。

08:56.913 --> 08:59.113
Patrick,
I've ruined everything.
帕特里克，
我毁了一切。

08:59.113 --> 09:02.780
- Oh, SpongeBob,
I wouldn't say that.
- 哦，海绵宝宝，
我不会这么说。

09:02.780 --> 09:04.413
- Our baby!
- 我们的宝贝！

09:04.413 --> 09:05.913
- I'll never mow you again!
- 我再也不会割你的了！

09:05.913 --> 09:08.680
- Take me money!
- Ow!
- 给我钱！
- 噢！

09:08.680 --> 09:11.880
Okay, SpongeBob,
you ruined everything.
好吧，海绵宝宝，
你毁了一切。

09:11.880 --> 09:14.380
- No sponge should have
this much power.
- 海绵不应该有
这么大的力量。

09:14.380 --> 09:16.313
all: We told you so.
全体：我们已经告诉过你了。

09:16.313 --> 09:17.313
- Not helping.
- 没有帮助。

09:17.313 --> 09:19.013
- Well, maybe I can help.
- 好吧，也许我能帮忙。

09:19.013 --> 09:21.380
I believe I have
something of yours.
我相信我有
你的东西。

09:21.380 --> 09:22.946
- My spatula!
- 我的铲子！

09:22.946 --> 09:24.380
Then what's this?
那这是什么？

09:24.380 --> 09:26.346
- That is my trident!
- 那是我的三叉戟！

09:26.346 --> 09:29.913
- Well, take your trident.
I don't want it anymore.
- 好吧，带上你的三叉戟。
我不再想要了。

09:29.913 --> 09:32.113
Whoa! Stop!
That wasn't me.
哇！停止！
那不是我。

09:32.113 --> 09:35.446
all: Too long away
from its true master,
全体：距离太远了
来自它真正的主人，

09:35.446 --> 09:37.546
the trident has run wild.
三叉戟已经狂奔。

09:37.546 --> 09:39.113
- What a jerk.
- 真是个混蛋。

09:39.113 --> 09:40.380
- [laughs]
- [笑]

09:40.380 --> 09:42.313
- Sorry.
Pardon me.
- 对不起。
对不起。

09:42.313 --> 09:44.280
It stuck!
它卡住了！

09:44.280 --> 09:45.913
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

09:45.913 --> 09:48.780
- Ahh!
Make it stop!
- 啊！
让它停下来！

09:53.613 --> 09:56.613
[triumphant music]
[胜利的音乐]

09:56.613 --> 09:57.846
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

09:57.846 --> 10:01.280
- You have been
one naughty trident.
- 你已经
一根淘气的三叉戟。

10:01.280 --> 10:02.446
- [whimpers]
- [呜咽]

10:02.446 --> 10:06.280
- Oh, I can't stay
mad at you.
- 哦，我不能留下来
生你的气。

10:06.280 --> 10:07.580
- [panting]
- [气喘吁吁]

10:07.580 --> 10:10.713
- Now let's see if we can
fix all of this.
- 现在让我们看看是否可以
解决这一切。

10:16.546 --> 10:17.646
- Give me back me money.
- 把钱还给我。

10:17.646 --> 10:21.346
- [baby cooing]
- [婴儿咕咕声]

10:21.346 --> 10:23.446
- Mow us good!
- 好好修剪我们吧！

10:25.446 --> 10:28.980
- You know, SpongeBob,
your spatula is just as powerful
- 你知道，海绵宝宝，
你的抹刀同样强大

10:28.980 --> 10:30.480
as my trident.
作为我的三叉戟。

10:30.480 --> 10:32.013
- Really?
- 真的吗？

10:32.013 --> 10:34.280
- Ha!
Not even close!
- 哈！
甚至还没有接近！

10:34.280 --> 10:35.313
[laughs]
[笑]

10:35.313 --> 10:37.146
But it's still pretty great.
但它仍然很棒。

10:37.146 --> 10:38.913
- Thanks for bailing me out,
Neptune.
- 谢谢你救我出来
海王星。

10:38.913 --> 10:40.380
If there's any way
I can ever help you,
如果有什么办法
我永远可以帮助你，

10:40.380 --> 10:41.546
just let me know.
请告诉我。

10:41.546 --> 10:44.780
- Well, there is one way.
- 嗯，有一种方法。

10:44.780 --> 10:46.513
There they are!
他们在那里！

10:46.513 --> 10:47.980
- [snarling]
- [咆哮]

10:47.980 --> 10:49.546
[both gasp]
[两人都喘气]

10:49.546 --> 10:51.280
- Let's get 'em!
- 让我们抓住他们！

10:51.280 --> 10:52.413
[yelling]
[大喊]

10:52.413 --> 10:53.413
- [growls]
- [咆哮]

10:53.413 --> 10:55.346
- [whimpers]
- [呜咽]

- [呜咽]